OL,3,GNEWSAHow close are we to running out of
OL,4,Awater?
OL,5,
OL,6,FReservoirs have hit record lows, severe
OL,7,Fdrought has been declared in parts of
OL,8,FEngland and large areas of the country
OL,9,Fface hosepipe bans. The government says
OL,10,Fmore than #100bn is being invested in
OL,11,Fwater infrastructure, with nine new
OL,12,Freservoirs in the pipeline. But, after
OL,13,Fthe hottest summer on record for the
OL,14,FUK, are we prepared for a future of
OL,15,Fmore extreme weather? And how close are
OL,16,Fwe to running out of water?
OL,18,FWimbleball reservoir on Exmoor attracts
OL,19,Fvisitors not only to sail and row, but
OL,20,Falso so admire the scenery and take a
OL,21,Fwalk.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
