OL,3,GNEWSAHow close are we to running out of
OL,4,Awater?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese days the lake is getting visitors
OL,7,Ffor another reason - to marvel at how
OL,8,Fempty the Somerset landmark is, even
OL,9,Fafter storms of the past week.
OL,11,F"It's shocking looking at it," said
OL,12,FMichael Bertulis. "You can see where
OL,13,Fthe water level should be.
